        {
          "id": 508435795,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Both `classify_mbtcp_packet` and `classify_mbrtu_packet` share the same \"issue\" where a manual preference is used.\n\nI wonder whether other heuristics would work (such as assuming that the server port is always lower than the client port). That should still work even if you have an incomplete PDU and would allow dropping the preferences. If that is not doable, ignore my suggestion and carry on :)",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
